<title>UK: Medeva, Peptide to form vaccine link.</title>
<headline>Medeva, Peptide to form vaccine link.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medeva Plc said on Thursday that it was to transfer non-injectable vaccine technology to Peptide Therapeutics Plc so that Peptide can pursue the development of a number of oral and nasal vaccines, including for E-coli, typhoid and influenza.</p>
<p>In a statement Medeva said it would also take a stake in Peptide, paying three million stg for 882,353 new shares.</p>
</text>
